n patito con ese estilo: cuerpo redondito, plástico brillante y ojos grandes, ideal para el juego y como favicon.</p><div class="oIb9lq_Box" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-clip="true" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-height="" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); flex-shrink: 0; height: auto; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0px; width: 100%;"><div class="oIb9lq_Box" data-d-align="center" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-width="" data-d-has-height="" data-d-justify="center" aria-label="Image unavailable" role="img" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); flex-shrink: 0; height: 100%; width: 100%;"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="text-lg" data-d-component="icon" style="color: var(--color-text-tertiary);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.161 3h9.678c.527 0 .982 0 1.356.03.395.033.789.104 1.167.297a3 3 0 0 1 1.311 1.311c.193.378.264.772.296 1.167.031.375.031.83.031 1.356v9.678c0 .527 0 .982-.03 1.356-.033.395-.104.789-.297 1.167a3 3 0 0 1-1.311 1.311c-.378.193-.772.264-1.167.296-.375.031-.83.031-1.356.031H7.16c-.527 0-.981 0-1.356-.03-.395-.033-.789-.104-1.167-.297a3 3 0 0 1-1.311-1.311c-.193-.378-.264-.772-.296-1.167A17.9 17.9 0 0 1 3 16.838V7.162c0-.527 0-.981.03-1.356.033-.395.104-.789.297-1.167a3 3 0 0 1 1.311-1.311c.378-.193.772-.264 1.167-.296C6.18 3 6.635 3 7.161 3ZM5.968 5.024c-.272.022-.373.06-.422.085a1 1 0 0 0-.437.437c-.025.05-.063.15-.085.422C5 6.25 5 6.623 5 7.2v6.386l.879-.879a3 3 0 0 1 4.242 0L16.414 19h.386c.577 0 .949 0 1.232-.024.272-.022.372-.06.422-.085a1 1 0 0 0 .437-.437c.025-.05.063-.15.085-.422C19 17.75 19 17.377 19 16.8V7.2c0-.577 0-.949-.024-1.232-.022-.272-.06-.373-.085-.422a1 1 0 0 0-.437-.437c-.05-.025-.15-.063-.422-.085C17.7