-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">Tengo una idea BRUTAL</h3><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text">Podemos hacer que este pato sea <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Duck.exe</span>, el exótico más raro del juego:</p><div class="oIb9lq_Box" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-clip="true" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-border="" data-d-has-height="" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); flex-shrink: 0; height: auto; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0px; width: 100%;"><div class="BjVYla_Image BjVYla_OverlayBox BjVYla_LoadingFrame" data-d-component="image" style="border-radius: 0px; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: 100%; width: 100%; overflow: hidden;"><img alt="Ducky" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="CrFGHG_Image BjVYla_Image BjVYla_LoadingImage" draggable="false" src="./Pato_files/SDDecM8bUuAm2Qz78d_vQIR1AK5qk_OttETjX5Xqw5ESCm95Iv98z6IbUL7kEm14ORie7cMmZf5tgGyB0VxGwLu3Rc7L3cMyExdbiSUBwwGRqg1WPAtK5Qur7yt8niC4SENYrN1ZjKhYlSUqPHf18m2yBy3mIwWM6HQJFmG2sQw" style="border-radius: 0px; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: 100%; width: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 0%;" data-loaded=""><div class="BjVYla_LoadingSurface" data-d-image-loading=""><div class="oIb9lq_Box _48e6ya_LoadingBlock" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="loading-block" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-width="" data-d-has-height="" style="--smoothing-background-color: light-dark(var(--dil-image-loading-light-bg, var(--theme-user-msg-bg, var(--color-background-info-surface))), var(--theme-user-msg-bg, var(--color-background-info-surface))); background-color: light-dark(var(--dil-image-loading-light-bg, var(--theme-user-msg-bg, var(--color-background-info-surface))), var(--theme-user-msg-bg, var(--color-backgr