 HTML debajo de <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">&lt;body&gt;</code>.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text">✅ CSS encima de <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">&lt;/head&gt;</code>.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text">✅ JavaScript encima de <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">&lt;/body&gt;</code>.</p></div></div></li></ul><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text"><span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">PERO</span> hay una cosa importante que quiero evitarte: ahora mismo el código busca <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">duck.png</code>. Si haces el commit sin subir esa imagen, el juego funcionará, pero en la pantalla de carga saldrá el icono roto donde va el pato.</p><h3 class="w6asjq_TextBase GgxHUa_Title" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">Haz esto mejor (30 segundos)</h3><ol class="PSWZZq_List" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text">Dale a <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Commit changes</span> del código. ✅</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text">Luego <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Add file → Upload files</span>.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text">Sube el pato como <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">duck.png</code></span>.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text">Otro <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Commit changes</span>.</p></div></div></li></ol><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-component="text">Así la pantalla de carga quedará perfecta desde el primer intento.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Accions de resposta" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-